{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23795","headline":"池鹤二首 二 · 白居易","name":"池鹤二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池中此鹤鹤中稀，恐是辽东老令威。\n带雪松枝翘膝胫，放花菱片缀毛衣。\n低回且向林间宿，奋迅终须天外飞。\n若问故巢知处在，主人相恋未能归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}